Z||000001||Eddie||11-04-1999||06:59 PM|||| Hay Rob<BR>	I have a hooker header on mine and 80 series flowmaster muffler . I can get you the part number later tonite when my wife gets home I am at work .I cant say how much more power I got from the header because the motor was done at the same time I had IT blue printed @ ported bored 40 over and hot cam. I can say that the muffler is will just ok it will never sound great but not bad for 2.5 it truns heads ||||reg||14
Z||000002||Formula||11-04-1999||07:09 PM||||Just a thought.  Could the V6 muffler work on the 4 cyl.? If you look at the diagrams it looks like it might be a direct replacement. ||||reg||1
